# Optional: include PRIVATE GitHub contributions in the homepage heatmap.
# Without this, the heatmap shows your PUBLIC contribution graph only.
#
# Create a token at https://github.com/settings/tokens
#   - Classic token: tick the "read:user" scope (add "repo" if private
#     contributions still don't appear).
#   - Or a fine-grained token with read-only "Profile" access.
# Then copy this file to .env.local and paste the token below.
#
# The token is read server-side only (never shipped to the browser) and
# .env.local is git-ignored.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
